 <p><strong>Lithology:</strong> {getValue(selectedFormation.lithology)}</p>
 <p><strong>Depth:</strong> {getValue(selectedFormation.depth_from)}' - {getValue(selectedFormation.depth_to)}'</p>
 <p><strong>Porosity:</strong> {getValue(selectedFormation.porosity)}%</p>
 <p><strong>Permeability:</strong> {getValue(selectedFormation.permeability)} mD</p>
